# hermes-hindsight secrets — TEMPLATE ONLY. Real values are written on the NAS
# and never committed. Git preserves neither ownership nor mode; the manifest
# that records both is appdata-templates/README.md.
#
# NAS PATH: /volume1/docker/appdata/hermes-hindsight/hindsight.env
# REQUIRED: root:root 0600 (holds a live OpenRouter API key)
#
# This is a SEPARATE OpenRouter key from the one in hermes-etc/hermes.env
# (operator decision 2026-09-14), so Hindsight's extraction/consolidation/reflect
# spend is isolated from the agent's and can be capped or revoked on its own.
#
# Consumed by compose/hermes-hindsight.yml's `env_file:`. Because Hindsight only
# reads LLM credentials from the environment, the key WILL appear in
# `docker inspect hermes-hindsight`. That is accepted: the agent's restricted
# socket proxy does not expose this container, so a prompt-injected agent cannot
# read it; only root and the permissive socket-proxy holders can.
HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_API_KEY=